### MessageFlow API — Sample HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@tenantAlpha = tenant-alpha
@tenantBeta = tenant-beta

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Create Message (Tenant Alpha)
# @name createMessageAlpha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantAlpha}}

{
  "tenantId": "tenant-alpha",
  "conversationId": "conv-100",
  "to": "+919876543210",
  "text": "Your Order #4567 has shipped via Express Delivery."
}

### 3. Create Second Message (Tenant Alpha)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantAlpha}}

{
  "tenantId": "tenant-alpha",
  "conversationId": "conv-100",
  "to": "+919876543210",
  "text": "Expected delivery date is tomorrow before 5 PM."
}

### 4. Create Message for Different Tenant (Tenant Beta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantBeta}}

{
  "tenantId": "tenant-beta",
  "conversationId": "conv-200",
  "to": "+14155552671",
  "text": "Tenant Beta confidential communication."
}

### 5. Fetch Single Message by ID (Tenant Alpha - Authorized)
# Replace {{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}} with actual ID or paste message ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantAlpha}}

### 6. Tenant Isolation Check: Tenant Beta attempts to view Tenant Alpha message (Should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantBeta}}

### 7. Fetch Conversation History with Pagination (Limit = 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/conv-100/messages?limit=20
x-tenant-id: {{tenantAlpha}}

### 8. Webhook: Ingest Provider Event (DELIVERED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-meta-001",
  "messageId": "{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-24T10:15:00.000Z"
}

### 9. Webhook Idempotency: Re-send identical eventId (Should return 200 duplicate, applied: false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-meta-001",
  "messageId": "{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-24T10:15:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Webhook Out-of-Order: Ingest older SENT event (Should not regress DELIVERED, but records sentAt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-meta-002",
  "messageId": "{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}",
  "status": "SENT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-24T10:05:00.000Z"
}

### 11. Webhook: Ingest READ Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-meta-003",
  "messageId": "{{createMessageAlpha.response.body.id}}",
  "status": "READ",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-24T10:20:00.000Z"
}

### 12. Webhook: Non-existent Message ID (Should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-unknown-999",
  "messageId": "msg-does-not-exist",
  "status": "SENT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-24T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 13. Swagger UI (Open in Browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-docs/

### 14. Swagger OpenAPI 3.0 Specification JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-docs.json
